LICH-010 Seed Corpus: WAL Integrity

WAL entry format: [Sequence:8][Length:4][CRC32:4][Data:Length]
  Header = 16 bytes, CRC32-IEEE over Data field.

Focus areas:
  - CRC verification (corruption detection)
  - Length field overflow (claims more data than available)
  - Sequence gap detection
  - Entry chain parsing (multiple entries concatenated)
